tail/id/10617/)\n\n[Coxing Kill](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4100/)[Delaware](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1291/) [Delaware, E. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1292/)\n\n[Delaware, W. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3416/)[Little Delaware](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3174/) [Dry Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1293/)\n\n[East Kill](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1296/)[Esopus Creek (1)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3849/) [Esopus Creek (2)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3848/)\n\n[Esopus Creek (3)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1301/)[Esopus Creek (4)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1302/) [Esopus Creek (5)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1303/)\n\n[Hannacrois Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1318/)[Kaaterskill Creek (1.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4236/) [Kaaterskill Creek (2.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1330/)\n\n[Kinderhook Creek  (3.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1333/)[Kiskatom Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4300/) [Mombaccus Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4302/)\n\n[Mill Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1344/)[Neversink (1.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1356/) [Neversink, E. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1358/)\n\n[Neversink, W. Branch](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1359/)[Peters Kill](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4304/) [Platte Kill](https://www